Nazeka — https://github.com/wareya/nazeka
Apache License 2.0. Nazeka ships no LICENSE file; its readme.md states the license. Full text
and the readme statement in third_party/nazeka/LICENSE.

JL's deconjugation rule set and algorithm derive from Nazeka's deconjugator, so the port in
src/deconj/ and data/deconjugation_rules.json carry Nazeka's attribution as well as JL's. The
popup layout and the default color scheme in src/popup/ follow Nazeka's presentation.

