LGPL-3.0-only, by the same author as MaruPop.

src/capture/kwingrabber.*, src/capture/authorization.*, src/capture/screenlayout.*,
src/ocr/screenaibackend.*, src/ocr/screenaiproto.*, src/app/pathrequester.* and
