meikiocr — https://github.com/rtr46/meikiocr
Apache License 2.0 for the library.

src/ocr/meikiocrbackend.*, src/ocr/meikipreprocess.* and src/ocr/meikipostprocess.* implement
the detection, recognition and post-processing pipeline of meikiocr/ocr.py: RGB input, bilinear
resize, [N,2] orig_target_sizes, int32 character codes, interval non-maximum suppression, the
swapped-pair fix, and vertical-segment assembly.

The ONNX model weights are LGPL-3.0-only, by rtr46. MaruPop ships no weights.
src/ocr/modelstore.* downloads them at runtime from the upstream Hugging Face repositories at a
pinned commit, into $XDG_DATA_HOME/marupop/models, and verifies each file against a pinned
SHA-256 digest and byte count.

