Chromium — https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src
BSD 3-Clause.

src/ocr/screenaiproto.* is a protobuf wire-format reader for chrome_screen_ai.VisualAnnotation.
The field numbers it reads are those declared in Chromium's
services/screen_ai/proto/chrome_screen_ai.proto. No Chromium code is reproduced.

The Chrome Screen AI component itself (libchromescreenai.so) is a proprietary Google component
with no redistribution grant. MaruPop ships no copy of it and loads the one the user installed,
from the directory the ScreenAiResourcesDir setting names.

