cjkvi-ids — https://github.com/cjkvi/cjkvi-ids
The upstream README distinguishes ids.txt, derived from CHISE (http://www.chise.org/),
whose license follows that project's terms, from other data. Refer to the upstream notice
and the applicable CHISE terms for ids.txt; do not infer its license from other repository files.
Its header credits the CJKVI Database and the CHISE IDS Database.

MaruPop ships no copy of ids.txt. src/dict/importers/idsimporter.* imports the file the user
downloads through the dictionary manager, which offers the repository's raw URL as a built-in
entry, into $XDG_DATA_HOME/marupop/dictionaries. The imported data fills the components row of
the popup's kanji card.

