MaruPop fixtures and correction rules

The correction rule source and generated table carry the existing MaruPop LGPL-3.0-only
attribution. The repository provides a standalone generator and an independently implemented
reference for synthetic regression cases; no external evaluation corpus is distributed.
See tests/data/README.md for fixture attribution and scope. The rules are heuristics, not a
claim of measured accuracy over an undistributed corpus.

