MaruPop links Qt, KDE Frameworks, LayerShellQt, Wayland, ONNX Runtime, OpenCV, SQLite and xxHash
from the build environment. They are not vendored here. Distributors must retain the notices
and license choices of the versions they ship; this source license does not replace those
libraries' terms. The source and notice inventory above describes the code and data carried
by this repository, not a redistribution grant for an externally installed Chrome component.
